So, this is the second criterion.

00:21:04.353 --> 00:21:11.451
The believers, the believers are described in
Quran as loving Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala most of all.

00:21:16.339 --> 00:21:17.639
That they are described as,

00:21:17.639 --> 00:21:19.025
(2:165) أَشَدُّ حُبًّۭا لِّلَّهِ

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:22.519
Their greatest love is for Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala.

00:21:22.802 --> 00:21:32.118
And this is to put myself on trial and find out if I am an idol worshipper or not, that I may be an idol worshipper who is unaware,

00:21:32.118 --> 00:21:38.083
I have to check my heart and see how I respond to Allah and
somebody else.

00:21:38.649 --> 00:21:48.720
And unfortunately in many Muslim gatherings, you say the word "Allah", and then silence, but then you say the word Muhammad,

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:51.098
