Dr. Khalifa: The wicked person who's headed for Hell will say,

00:25:21.577 --> 00:25:24.474
(25:28) يَـٰوَيْلَتَىٰ لَيْتَنِى لَمْ أَتَّخِذْ فُلَانًا خَلِيلًۭا

00:25:27.901 --> 00:25:30.634
"I wish I didn't befriend a certain person..."

00:25:30.917 --> 00:25:32.634
(25:29) لَّقَدْ أَضَلَّنِى عَنِ ٱلذِّكْرِ

00:25:32.634 --> 00:25:35.248
[25:29]  "He has led me away from the message after ... "

00:25:36.003 --> 00:25:38.003
which is obviously the Quran.

00:25:38.003 --> 00:25:39.295
(15:9) إِنَّا نَحْنُ نَزَّلْنَا ٱلذِّكْرَ

00:25:39.295 --> 00:25:40.634
(unintelligible) Zikr (ذِّكْرَ)

00:25:40.870 --> 00:25:42.256
(25:29) لَّقَدْ أَضَلَّنِى عَنِ ٱلذِّكْرِ

00:25:42.256 --> 00:25:44.256
He has taken me away from the Quran.

00:25:44.775 --> 00:25:45.878
(25:29) بَعْدَ إِذْ جَآءَنِى

00:25:45.878 --> 00:25:46.981
After I (unintelligible) it.

00:25:47.500 --> 00:25:49.500
(25:29) وَكَانَ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ لِلْإِنسَـٰنِ خَذُولًۭا

00:25:49.736 --> 00:25:54.237
As I said at the beginning of the lecture, it is because of Satan, because of the (unintelligible).

00:25:54.520 --> 00:25:55.623
(25:30) وَقَالَ ٱلرَّسُولُ

00:25:55.623 --> 00:25:56.867
And this is on the Day of Judgement.

00:25:56.867 --> 00:26:00.661
(25:30) يَـٰرَبِّ إِنَّ قَوْمِى ٱتَّخَذُوا۟ هَـٰذَا ٱلْقُرْءَانَ مَهْجُورًۭا

00:26:00.883 --> 00:26:03.459
Obviously, there was no Quran before the prophet.

00:26:04.072 --> 00:26:08.256
Obviously, the Quran was rejected by people
who received the Quran.

00:26:10.852 --> 00:26:16.439
People who followed the messenger received the Quran and rejected it.

00:26:17.383 --> 00:26:20.657
(25:31) وَكَذَٰلِكَ جَعَلْنَا لِكُلِّ نَبِىٍّ عَدُوًّۭا مِّنَ ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ

00:26:20.940 --> 00:26:26.946
We thus set enemies against the prophets from among the criminals.

00:26:27.229 --> 00:26:35.553
And this exactly is the verse that is found in the third criterion to find out if I am an idol worshipper or not.

00:26:36.355 --> 00:26:44.018
We find that in Sura Al-An 'ãm, number 6, verses 112-116, it says exactly the same words.

00:26:44.018 --> 00:26:46.018
(6:112) وَكَذَٰلِكَ جَعَلْنَا لِكُلِّ نَبِىٍّ

00:26:46.018 --> 00:26:50.000
We set up against every prophet, and this includes the final prophet,

00:26:50.472 --> 00:26:52.472
عَدُوًّۭا
enemies

00:26:52.802 --> 00:26:55.132
شَيَـٰطِينَ ٱلْإِنسِ وَٱلْجِنِّ

00:26:55.132 --> 00:26:58.406
humans and jinns devils

00:26:58.642 --> 00:27:01.775
يُوحِى بَعْضُهُمْ إِلَىٰ بَعْضٍۢ زُخْرُفَ ٱلْقَوْلِ غُرُورًۭا

00:27:01.775 --> 00:27:07.315
who teach each other some fancy words to mislead.

00:27:08.150 --> 00:27:10.599
And they are taking those
words to the prophet.

00:27:11.968 --> 00:27:13.968
 وَلَوْ شَآءَ رَبُّكَ مَا فَعَلُوهُ

00:27:14.629 --> 00:27:17.951
Had your Lord willed, they will not have done that

00:27:18.386 --> 00:27:25.273
Why did God will that these enemies of the prophet fabricate lies? Why did He will that?

00:27:25.509 --> 00:27:29.727
(6:113) وَلِتَصْغَىٰٓ إِلَيْهِ أَفْـِٔدَةُ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ

00:27:29.727 --> 00:27:31.727
In the criterion. See? The same words.

00:27:31.727 --> 00:27:33.161
لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ

00:27:33.520 --> 00:27:39.231
In order for the minds of those who do not really believe to listen to those fabrications,

00:27:40.694 --> 00:27:41.750
وَلِيَرْضَوْهُ

00:27:41.750 --> 00:27:44.974
and to be
happy with them, to accept these fabrications,

00:27:45.352 --> 00:27:47.824
وَلِيَقْتَرِفُوا۟ مَا هُم مُّقْتَرِفُونَ

00:27:47.824 --> 00:27:52.609
and to really commit what they are supposed to commit. Because there are people who say

00:27:52.609 --> 00:27:59.329
"We are Muslims. We believe. I believe in God. I believe in the Hereafter. I believe in the final prophet. I believe in all the messengers."

00:27:59.801 --> 00:28:03.783
But in their mouths,
they're denying what their mouths say.

00:28:03.783 --> 00:28:06.302
But they are not even aware. They don't know.

00:28:08.615 --> 00:28:20.479
So, these fabrications, Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala wills that they exist in the world, in order to tell us whether I am a real believer or a false believer.

00:28:21.942 --> 00:28:27.340
وَلِتَصْغَىٰٓ إِلَيْهِ أَفْـِٔدَةُ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ وَلِيَرْضَوْهُ 
(6:113) وَلِيَقْتَرِفُوا۟ مَا هُم مُّقْتَرِفُونَ

00:28:28.008 --> 00:28:34.900
So, how do we know that
this has to do with utterances different than the Quran?

00:28:34.900 --> 00:28:38.599
The next verse tells us that, the next Aya says,

00:28:38.882 --> 00:28:40.882
(6:114) أَفَغَيْرَ ٱللَّهِ أَبْتَغِى حَكَمًۭا

00:28:41.118 --> 00:28:45.147
Do I seek other than Allah as a source of wisdom or as a judge?

00:28:45.147 --> 00:28:50.545
(6:114) أَفَغَيْرَ ٱللَّهِ أَبْتَغِى حَكَمًۭا وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَنزَلَ إِلَيْكُمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ مُفَصَّلًۭا

00:28:50.828 --> 00:28:55.613
When He sends down to you this book, fully detailed.

00:28:55.613 --> 00:28:56.716
مُفَصَّلًۭا

00:28:57.330 --> 00:29:01.501
Where do, why do you go to another source? This is what the verse is saying.

00:29:01.501 --> 00:29:06.286
And this is the criterion that tells me whether
I am an idol worshipper or not.

00:29:06.758 --> 00:29:08.428
The second criterion told us

00:29:08.428 --> 00:29:09.578
(17:46) ٱلْقُرْءَانِ وَحْدَهُۥ

00:29:09.578 --> 00:29:11.578
This criterion says

00:29:11.861 --> 00:29:13.625
(6:114) أَفَغَيْرَ ٱللَّهِ أَبْتَغِى حَكَمًۭا

00:29:13.625 --> 00:29:20.000
Shall I seek other than Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala as a source of wisdom?

00:29:20.000 --> 00:29:22.850
Who sends down to us this book, fully detailed,

00:29:22.850 --> 00:29:23.576
مُفَصَّلًۭا

00:29:23.576 --> 00:29:25.954
There is no other translation for the word
مُفَصَّلًۭا

00:29:27.954 --> 00:29:32.833
And the verse goes on to say that even Christians and Jews recognize that this book is from Allah, Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala.

00:29:32.833 --> 00:29:38.326
وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ يَعْلَمُونَ أَنَّهُۥ مُنَزَّلٌۭ مِّن رَّبِّكَ بِٱلْحَقِّ ۖ فَلَا 
(6:114) تَكُونَنَّ مِنَ ٱلْمُمْتَرِينَ

00:29:38.326 --> 00:29:40.562
The verse before that, by the way, ends by saying,

00:29:40.562 --> 00:29:41.996
(6:112) فَذَرْهُمْ وَمَا يَفْتَرُونَ

00:29:42.374 --> 00:29:46.545
That the commandment to you and to me is to abandon these fabrications

00:29:46.545 --> 00:29:52.179
that are, are done by the enemies of the prophet and they are fancy.

00:29:52.179 --> 00:29:53.518
(6:112) زُخْرُفَ ٱلْقَوْلِ

00:29:54.520 --> 00:29:57.200
Dr. Khalifa: And they are called in the
Quran as fabrications.

00:29:57.200 --> 00:29:58.303
A man: (unintelligible)

00:29:58.303 --> 00:30:04.206
The next verse, the next verse confirms the verse that says
that the Quran is Mufassal (مُفَصَّل).

00:30:04.631 --> 00:30:07.905
(6:115) وَتَمَّتْ كَلِمَتُ رَبِّكَ صِدْقًۭا وَعَدْلًۭا

00:30:08.660 --> 00:30:11.698
[6:115]  The word of your Lord is complete,* in truth and justice. ...

00:30:12.497 --> 00:30:24.287
So, it makes sense that if I believe God when He says that the book is detailed, if I believe God when He says that the book is complete...

00:30:30.235 --> 00:30:47.151
There's one more verse that I would like to mention that if you go to any other source besides the Quran, you are setting up another god besides Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala.

00:30:47.151 --> 00:30:50.897
This is what the Quran says. This is what
Allah says. It says,

00:30:50.897 --> 00:30:52.897
(6:19) قُلْ أَىُّ شَىْءٍ أَكْبَرُ شَهَـٰدَةًۭ

00:30:52.897 --> 00:30:54.614
Whose testimony is best?

00:30:54.614 --> 00:30:55.859
 قُلِ ٱللَّهُ

00:30:55.859 --> 00:30:58.425
Say "God's" testimony is the best.

00:31:02.059 --> 00:31:04.201
Let me read the verse so I don't make any mistake.

00:31:04.579 --> 00:31:06.579
Verse, verse 19, Sura 6.

00:31:09.222 --> 00:31:10.000
In the verse it says,

00:31:10.000 --> 00:31:12.897
(6:19) وَأُوحِىَ إِلَىَّ هَـٰذَا ٱلْقُرْءَانُ لِأُنذِرَكُم بِهِۦ وَمَنۢ بَلَغَ

00:31:12.897 --> 00:31:13.764
This is what I want to say.

00:31:13.764 --> 00:31:20.000
That this Quran, by name, was given to me to preach
to you and to whomever it reaches.

00:31:21.133 --> 00:31:23.794
(6:19) أَئِنَّكُمْ لَتَشْهَدُونَ أَنَّ مَعَ ٱللَّهِ ءَالِهَةً أُخْرَىٰ

00:31:25.566 --> 00:31:27.793
Dr. Khalifa: You set up other gods besides God.

00:31:27.793 --> 00:31:28.849
A man: (unintelligible)

00:31:29.463 --> 00:31:30.613
Dr. Khalifa: This is what I was looking for.

00:31:31.887 --> 00:31:34.925
A man: (unintelligible)

00:31:34.925 --> 00:31:36.925
Dr. Khalifa: 
(6:19) قُلْ أَىُّ شَىْءٍ أَكْبَرُ شَهَـٰدَةًۭ

00:31:37.350 --> 00:31:39.350
Whose testimony is best?

00:31:40.672 --> 00:31:42.624
 قُلِ ٱللَّهُ
Say "Allah"

00:31:42.624 --> 00:31:45.521
God's testimony is the best.

00:31:45.521 --> 00:31:47.079
شَهِيدٌۢ بَيْنِى وَبَيْنَكُمْ

00:31:47.079 --> 00:31:49.079
He's the witness between me and you.

00:31:50.000 --> 00:31:52.189
 وَأُوحِىَ إِلَىَّ هَـٰذَا ٱلْقُرْءَانُ

00:31:52.189 --> 00:31:54.189
And I was given this Quran.

00:31:54.519 --> 00:31:55.717
لِأُنذِرَكُم بِهِۦ

00:31:55.717 --> 00:31:57.387
to preach to you with it

00:31:57.387 --> 00:31:58.254
وَمَنۢ بَلَغَ

00:31:58.254 --> 00:31:59.717
and whomever it reaches.

00:32:01.180 --> 00:32:04.407
 أَئِنَّكُمْ لَتَشْهَدُونَ أَنَّ مَعَ ٱللَّهِ ءَالِهَةً أُخْرَىٰ

00:32:04.407 --> 00:32:06.265
What is the connection with the Quran to
this?

00:32:06.831 --> 00:32:14.306
The prophet is told to say "I was given the Quran to preach to you and all the generations after that until the end of the world."

00:32:14.731 --> 00:32:16.731
What's the connection between

00:32:16.731 --> 00:32:18.920
 (6:19) أَئِنَّكُمْ لَتَشْهَدُونَ أَنَّ مَعَ ٱللَّهِ ءَالِهَةً أُخْرَىٰ

00:32:18.920 --> 00:32:26.159
If you set up anything besides this Quran that was given to the prophet to preach to all generations in the world,

00:32:26.159 --> 00:32:28.159
you are setting up another god besides God.

00:32:29.056 --> 00:32:32.850
Who's the answer to say "I do not testify
as you do."

00:32:33.794 --> 00:32:35.794
 قُلْ إِنَّمَا هُوَ إِلَـٰهٌۭ وَٰحِدٌۭ

00:32:35.794 --> 00:32:38.124
Say "it is only one god."

00:32:38.407 --> 00:32:39.557
He's only one god.

00:32:39.557 --> 00:32:41.274
وَإِنَّنِى بَرِىٓءٌۭ مِّمَّا تُشْرِكُونَ

00:32:41.274 --> 00:32:43.274
And I disown anything you say.

00:32:45.274 --> 00:32:49.445
Why is there prophet's oath in the Quran?

00:32:49.775 --> 00:32:52.011
The strongest swearing in the Quran.

00:32:53.710 --> 00:32:57.692
You know, there are many difference of swearing
and oath in the Quran.

00:33:00.618 --> 00:33:03.043
There's (unintelligible Arabic)

00:33:05.969 --> 00:33:09.338
(unintelligible Arabic)

00:33:09.633 --> 00:33:16.211
There are many, there are many kinds of swearing in the Quran,
but the absolute, the most powerful,

00:33:16.211 --> 00:33:21.987
the strongest swearing in the Quran, you find in Sura Al-Haaqqah, Sura 69. There is

00:33:21.987 --> 00:33:23.987
(69:38) فَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِمَا تُبْصِرُونَ

00:33:23.987 --> 00:33:26.789
[69:38]  I swear by what you see.

00:33:27.261 --> 00:33:28.742
(69:39) وَمَا لَا تُبْصِرُونَ

00:33:28.742 --> 00:33:30.223
[69:39]  And what you do not see.

00:33:30.223 --> 00:33:32.223
Now, there's nothing stronger than that.

00:33:32.998 --> 00:33:40.190
God, Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala is swearing
by what you see, everything you see, and everything you do not see.

00:33:40.190 --> 00:33:42.190
Which means what? I swear by everything.

00:33:42.190 --> 00:33:45.889
This is absolutely the most powerful oath
in Quran.

00:33:45.889 --> 00:33:48.267
(69:38) فَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِمَا تُبْصِرُونَ
(69:39) وَمَا لَا تُبْصِرُونَ

00:33:48.267 --> 00:33:50.456
(69:40) إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلُ رَسُولٍۢ كَرِيمٍۢ

00:33:50.456 --> 00:33:53.778
[69:40]  This (Quran) is the utterance of an honorable messenger.

00:33:54.344 --> 00:33:56.344
(69:41) وَمَا هُوَ بِقَوْلِ شَاعِرٍۢ

00:33:56.344 --> 00:33:58.344
[69:41]  It is not the utterance of a poet; ...

00:33:58.580 --> 00:34:00.000
(69:41) قَلِيلًۭا مَّا تُؤْمِنُونَ

00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:02.000
[69:41]  ... rarely do you believe.

00:34:02.425 --> 00:34:04.000
(69:42) وَلَا بِقَوْلِ كَاهِنٍۢ

00:34:04.000 --> 00:34:06.897
[69:42]  It is not the utterance of a soothsayer; ...

00:34:06.897 --> 00:34:09.039
(69:42) قَلِيلًۭا مَّا تَذَكَّرُونَ

00:34:09.511 --> 00:34:11.468
[69:42]  ... rarely do you take heed.

00:34:11.987 --> 00:34:14.129
(69:43) تَنزِيلٌۭ مِّن رَّبِّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ

00:34:14.129 --> 00:34:17.167
[69:43]  A revelation from the Lord of the world.

00:34:17.403 --> 00:34:18.931
(69:43) تَنزِيلٌۭ مِّن رَّبِّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ

00:34:19.592 --> 00:34:22.206
(69:44) وَلَوْ تَقَوَّلَ عَلَيْنَا بَعْضَ ٱلْأَقَاوِيلِ

00:34:22.442 --> 00:34:29.256
Dr. Khalifa: And if he uttered anything else, he adds
any more, Let me read the...

00:34:29.256 --> 00:34:32.058
Dr. Khalifa (Speaking Arabic): (unintelligible)
A man (Speaking Arabic): (unintelligible) Na'am (Yes).

00:34:32.908 --> 00:34:34.389
Dr. Khalifa:
لَأَخَذْنَا مِنْهُ بِٱلْوَتِينَ

00:34:34.389 --> 00:34:36.011
A man: 
(69:45) لَأَخَذْنَا مِنْهُ بِٱلْيَمِينِ

00:34:36.011 --> 00:34:38.389
Dr. Khalifa: 
(69:45) لَأَخَذْنَا مِنْهُ بِٱلْيَمِينِ
(69:46) ثُمَّ لَقَطَعْنَا مِنْهُ ٱلْوَتِينَ

00:34:38.625 --> 00:34:40.625
He would have been fired as a prophet.

00:34:40.908 --> 00:34:42.908
He would have punished him severely.

00:34:44.135 --> 00:34:49.061
(69:46) ثُمَّ لَقَطَعْنَا مِنْهُ ٱلْوَتِينَ
(69:47) فَمَا مِنكُم مِّنْ أَحَدٍ عَنْهُ حَـٰجِزِينَ

00:34:49.061 --> 00:34:51.958
None of you can protect him from Me.

00:34:51.958 --> 00:34:55.185
This is the word came out of the final prophet's
mouth.

00:34:56.082 --> 00:34:56.808
And he said,

00:34:56.808 --> 00:35:00.743
[69:38]  I swear by what you see.
[69:39]  And what you do not see.

00:35:00.743 --> 00:35:04.584
[69:40]  This is the utterance of an honorable messenger.

00:35:05.103 --> 00:35:06.678
Obviously, the Quran is

00:35:06.678 --> 00:35:08.133
(69:43) تَنزِيلٌۭ مِّن رَّبِّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ

00:35:08.699 --> 00:35:10.982
[69:40]  This is the utterance of an honorable messenger.

00:35:10.982 --> 00:35:15.011
[69:41]  It is not the utterance of a poet; rarely do you believe it.

00:35:15.908 --> 00:35:20.362
[69:42]  Nor the utterance of a soothsayer; rarely do you take heed.

00:35:21.211 --> 00:35:26.137
This is, this is Allah's announcement that the majority of human beings will not take heed.

00:35:27.506 --> 00:35:29.223
