00:37:31.336 --> 00:37:42.000
The initial decree for Fasting prohibited sexual intercourse throughout the month of Ramadan, day and night, When it came through Ibrahim.

00:37:42.000 --> 00:37:49.652
When the Quran came, this was modified, and
allowing intercourse during the night of Ramadan.

00:37:50.000 --> 00:37:58.359
So, the verse is very clear saying that you used to cheat your souls by having intercourse with your wives during the night, but now,

00:37:58.359 --> 00:38:01.912
as of now, you may have intercourse with your wives.

00:38:01.912 --> 00:38:08.773
So, it's very clear that all religious practices
in Islam came to us through Ibrahim.

00:38:08.773 --> 00:38:12.982
And we must remember that Ibrahim is called
the father of Islam.

00:38:13.218 --> 00:38:17.200
(22:78) مِّلَّةَ أَبِيكُمْ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ ۚ هُوَ سَمَّىٰكُمُ ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ مِن قَبْلُ

00:38:17.200 --> 00:38:20.000
This is verse 78 of Sura 22.

00:38:20.235 --> 00:38:23.280
So, what did Ibrahim contribute being the father
